 (descr "Littelfuse 178.6764.0001 MINI FL1 PCB fuse holder for MINI blade fuses, through-hole. Body, drill size and locating-peg hole derived from the JLCEDA/EasyEDA Official Library footprint 178.6764.0001 (LCSC C142933; https://lceda.cn/ , https://easyeda.com), which places the terminals 8.0 mm apart; the Littelfuse datasheet says the terminals fit a 7.62 mm pitch. Terminal holes are slots that accept either spacing. Confirm against the Littelfuse 2D print (littelfuse.com/MINIFL1) before ordering.")
